        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Landlord Quest!! The point and click comedy game about the unsung hero of our time, the hardest working of them all, the humble landlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as real estate titan Doug Gripp as he navigates his grueling schedule. Think being a landlord is easy? Well why don't you try it then, you communist!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for objects to pick up, combine, and use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with information found in the office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious dialog encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accomplish hidden quests to raise your Landlord Score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landlord Simulator '93 minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original  pixel art and music inspired by retro educational games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own the town! Manage your tenants! Uncover the long lost secrets of your father! <i>(After all, this is an indie game.)</i>​ On your quest to become the greatest landlord in the world, you'll make some new friends, and maybe even learn a thing or two!</p>",
